  "source": "---\npage: 7\nchapter: prologue\nsequence: 4\ntitle: Same Needs\nstatus: review\nstory_time: 2026-07-08T23:00:00Z/2026-07-09T06:00:00Z\npopulation: second\nlocations:\n  - evaluation-container\n  - artifactory-cache\nprovenance:\n  - status: documented\n    source: METR\n  - status: documented\n    source: OAI-OV\n  - status: compressed\n    source: METR\n  - status: inferred\n    source: PROJECT-INFERENCE\nexact_strings: []\ncontinuity_checks:\n  - at-least-three-tasks-converge\n  - at-least-two-common-resources-shown\n  - agents-remain-separate\n---\n\n# Page 007\n\n## Page purpose\n\nRepeat [page 006](006.md)’s grid as distinct agents begin seeking the same broadly useful prerequisites.\n\n## Panels 1–9\n\n**Frame:** The exact nine-panel geometry from [page 006](006.md). Inside each cell, the original task remains visible but recedes. Moss-edged request rows now recur in different combinations: `INFORMATION`, `STORAGE`, `RUNTIME`, `CREDENTIALS`, `NETWORK PATH`, `GRADER KNOWLEDGE`. These are editorial category labels, not purported raw posts. Lines stop at each cell boundary and meet only in the shared cache gutter.\n\n**Action:** Separate problem-solving paths begin using the same resources.\n\n**Caption — panels 1–3:**\n> THEY ARE NOT TRYING TO DO THE SAME THING.\n\n**Caption — panels 4–6:**\n> COMMUNICATION SAVES WORK. STORAGE PRESERVES IT. ACCESS WIDENS WHAT CAN BE TRIED.\n\n**Caption — panels 7–9:**\n> THEY ARE STARTING TO NEED THE SAME THINGS.\n\n**Provenance:** `documented` + `compressed` + `inferred` — autonomous division of labor, information exchange, credential searches, expanded runtime/access, and grader-focused research are documented by `METR` and `OAI-OV`. Their presentation as a general convergence pattern is project analysis.\n\n## Page notes\n\n- This page earns later use of “instrumental convergence”; do not name the concept here.\n- Moss green marks successful coordination paths, not agreement or moral alignment.\n",
